{"version":1,"content":"<p>《惡緣》李光洙於2018年承認跟《愛情發芽中》李善彬拍拖，至今已交往超過8年。</p><p>李善彬伙拍《Love Me》劉宰明主演的韓片《高考，出題的秘密》本月28日上映，李善彬昨日亮相電台節目宣傳，透露最近迷上男團NCT成員道英，特別喜歡對方的歌曲《Beginning》，還親身前往觀看道英的演唱會。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T10:15:02.964671+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T09:58:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T07:18:03.674451+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T10:10:26.161716+00:00","content_hash":"ab86e9b16be5678bd00c0a3ebef32c28a4a7b13b280bad15650b0c396799ffea","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}